{"id":"0e9a7e858e6fae46","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-partial-isometry.md","title":"Partial Isometry","display":"df-partial-isometry — Partial Isometry","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-partial-isometry","aliases":["58-df-partial-isometry","Partial Isometry"],"display":"df-partial-isometry — Partial Isometry","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-adjoint.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-partial-isometry"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-partial-isometry</span><span>Partial Isometry</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-isometry — Partial Isometry"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md\">../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md\">../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"200eacd293b1282b\" href=\"?note=200eacd293b1282b\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-adjoint.md\">../batch12/58-df-adjoint.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,K\">\\(H,K\\)</span>（Hilbert 空间）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V,V^\\ast\\in V\">\\(V,V^\\ast\\in V\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:H\\to K\">\\(V:H\\to K\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(V,V^\\ast,H,K)\">\\(\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(V,V^\\ast,H,K)\\)</span>（伴随关系，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"200eacd293b1282b\" href=\"?note=200eacd293b1282b\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-adjoint.md\">../batch12/58-df-adjoint.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S\\)</span>（有界算子谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md\">../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_V\\coloneqq(\\ker V)^\\perp\">\\(N_V\\coloneqq(\\ker V)^\\perp\\)</span>（初始空间）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{N_V}\">\\(I_{N_V}\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_V\">\\(N_V\\)</span> 上的恒等算子）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialIsometry}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialIsometry}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（此处定义的偏等距谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}isometry}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PartialIsometry}_S(V,H,K)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(V,H,K)\n\\land\\exists V^\\ast\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(V,V^\\ast,H,K)\n\\land\n(V^\\ast\\circ V)\\upharpoonright N_V=I_{N_V}\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}isometry}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PartialIsometry}_S(V,H,K)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(V,H,K)\n\\land\\exists V^\\ast\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(V,V^\\ast,H,K)\n\\land\n(V^\\ast\\circ V)\\upharpoonright N_V=I_{N_V}\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Partial isometry: isometry defined on orthogonal complement of kernel</li>\n<li>Initial projection: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^*V\">\\(V^*V\\)</span>, final projection: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"VV^*\">\\(VV^*\\)</span></li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 是偏等距，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^*V\">\\(V^*V\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"VV^*\">\\(VV^*\\)</span> 分别是初始空间与终止空间闭包上的正交投影；这是派生定理，不作为定义子句。</li>\n<li>Unitary 算子必须同时满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^*V=I_H\">\\(V^*V=I_H\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"VV^*=I_K\">\\(VV^*=I_K\\)</span>；只满足前者是 isometry，未必满射。</li>\n<li>每个 Hilbert 空间间的有界算子都有极分解 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=V|T|\">\\(T=V|T|\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 是按核与值域闭包确定的偏等距。</li>\n<li>伴随不再作为未绑定的记号直接出现在断言中；它由上游四元伴随关系存在量化，并与复合的定义域、陪域一致。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kadison and Ringrose, Operator Algebras</li>\n<li>Conway, A Course in Operator Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-adjoint.md","status":"resolved","id":"200eacd293b1282b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-adjoint.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-adjoint.md","status":"resolved","id":"200eacd293b1282b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(V,V^\\ast,H,K)$（伴随关系，见 [[../batch12/58-df-adjoint.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S$（有界算子谓词，见 [[../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H,K","display":false},{"tex":"V,V^\\ast\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"V:H\\to K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(V,V^\\ast,H,K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S","display":false},{"tex":"N_V\\coloneqq(\\ker V)^\\perp","display":false},{"tex":"I_{N_V}","display":false},{"tex":"N_V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialIsometry}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}isometry}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PartialIsometry}_S(V,H,K)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{BoundedOperator}_S(V,H,K)\n\\land\\exists V^\\ast\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(V,V^\\ast,H,K)\n\\land\n(V^\\ast\\circ V)\\upharpoonright N_V=I_{N_V}\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"V^*V","display":false},{"tex":"VV^*","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"V^*V","display":false},{"tex":"VV^*","display":false},{"tex":"V^*V=I_H","display":false},{"tex":"VV^*=I_K","display":false},{"tex":"T=V|T|","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1894,"backlinks":[{"id":"c6ace29e12d6a2ff","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-941","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-partial-isometry.md|58-df-partial-isometry]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["b70ce791d5b1a19b","2ad9c248fe18df37","200eacd293b1282b"]}